      "Language": "chi",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This is the first report of 16 cases with microscopic vasculitis of the tongue in Chinese literatures. The clinical manifestations and histopathology of the disease were described. The treatment of promoting blood circulation to remove blood was used stasis. Probably the microscopic vasculitis plays an importment role in the glossodynia."},
